<title>FRANCE: CIC shares drop after sale called off.</title>
<headline>CIC shares drop after sale called off.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in CIC bank slipped on Friday in reaction to Finance Minister Jean Arthuis's decision on Thursday to call off the planned sale of CIC shares.</p>
<p>Only some seven percent of shares in CIC are held by the public, the rest is held by state-owned insurer Groupe des Assurances Nationales (GAN).</p>
</text>
